This is a wikistats (cloud) instance.

After applying the puppet role for the first time you
have to deploy the wikistats app files.

run 'deploy-wikistats deploy'

deploy-wikistats <action>

deploy: syncs files from /srv/wikistats (where puppet git pulls to automatically) into the right places.

diff: identifies files that have local hacks that have not been deployed.

backup: syncs files currently used to a backup location at /usr/lib/wikistats/backup.

restore: syncs files from the backup location (/usr/lib/wikistats/backup) into the right places.

